业务逻辑绑定到了内部依赖服务的状态。当内部依赖服务不可用时，应用按设计返回 HTTP 503 以表示自身处于降级/不可用状态，从而导致 K8s 判定应用不健康，引发持续 `NotReady`。\n\n证据支撑：\n- 探针事件明确记录 `dial tcp... connection refused`（底层连接失败）与 `HTTP probe failed... statuscode: 503`（应用层返回失败）同时存在。\n- 日志显示应用因 `dependency unavailable` 主动返回 503，且追踪数据表明业务请求与探针检查处于相同的故障观察模式。\n\n**证据不足/待确认**：目前事实未明确指出具体的“内部依赖服务”是什么（如数据库、缓存或下游 API），因此无法确认是依赖服务本身故障、网络策略拦截还是应用配置错误导致的依赖不可用。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 71.8s (Evidence 65.2s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 102.756, "metrics": {"run_id": "0a715c0d0fd34d84", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 102.76306462287903, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 102763.06462287903, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 92124.47047233582, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 25092.311143875122, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 10259.396076202393}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16355.338335037231, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 71805.37486076355, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14580.692529678345, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

